{'symbol': 'FRC', 'date': '2022-11-08 09:00:00', 'title': 'WEALTH MANAGEMENT TEAM LED BY MARC KOCH AND CHRISTOPHER WALTERS JOINS FIRST REPUBLIC', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FIRST REPUBLIC BANK (NYSE:FRC), A LEADING PRIVATE BANK AND WEALTH MANAGEMENT COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT A FIVE-MEMBER TEAM LED BY MARC KOCH AND CHRISTOPHER WALTERS HAS JOINED FIRST REPUBLIC INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT IN NEW YORK AND CONNECTICUT.'}